{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a quiet room. Four doors surround you. One will lead you deeper. One might lead you out. But <strong>where is The Fifth Door?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fifth Door is a <strong>short walking simulator</strong> inspired by Silent Hill, Amnesia, and Resident Evil, and the claustrophobic tension of films like The Cube and The Grudge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you enjoy games like</strong> Observation Duty, The Exit 8, Slender, or Fatal Frame, you\u2019ll feel right at home here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dreamlike space filled with over <strong>36 unique puzzles</strong> with surprising variations. Something is always changing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for a single-session experience: <strong>playable in 30\u201360 minutes.</strong></p>More content unlocks when you find The 5th door for about <strong>2+ hours of gameplay total</strong> ","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Playable Teaser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623590/cd658117ea96c5a0aaff889cd52f5b676025567c.jpg"},{"name":"Don't forget","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623590/c351546d40993b04e5629db9b9d6a1e550f98c11.jpg"},{"name":"Mortal frame","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623590/dfa6c129312bcaab4a749151d72279ceddbeb3c0.jpg"},{"name":"The 5th page","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623590/80bcc2045e3b36db29495f9150264be002018a2a.jpg"},{"name":"The 5th Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623590/187e12188f3b7241f99aa59e95182265e74eda9e.jpg"},{"name":"Insanity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3623590/fc8fc3fff981b52f3d52b99f52ba6389671f4ad5.jpg"},{"name":"Im on Door Duty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com